{
 "encounter_id": "00696",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Hello. Um, I've noticed a yellowish bump on my eye, by the coloured bit, and I don't like it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me hear more about it. When did you spot it?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "About two months ago, in the mirror. It was tiny, and it's grown a little."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Does it bother you in any way?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My eye feels gritty, like there's sand in it. Mostly when the wind's blowing."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any redness or watering?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "It goes red now and then, and waters a bit, particularly outdoors."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any change in your sight, blurriness?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, my sight is fine. No blurring at all."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Are you using anything on the eye?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Lubricating drops, four times a day, for dry eyes. They help a little."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And you've had dry eyes for a while?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Years. And hay fever too, in the summer."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What work do you do?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'm a gardener. I'm outside all day, in the sun and wind."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me check your pulse and blood pressure first, it's routine. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Pulse 72, blood pressure 122 over 76.",
   "pause": 10.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Fine? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Fine. Now sit at the microscope for me, chin on the rest, look straight ahead. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Like this?",
   "pause": 20.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Right. There's a small, raised, yellowish lump on the white of the eye, on the nose side, next to the cornea, and the surface around it is slightly red."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is it a growth? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It's a benign thickening of the surface, and from the look of it I'd say it's a pinguecula."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "What causes it? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Sun, wind and dust over the years, so it's very common in people who work outdoors. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is it dangerous? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "No, it isn't cancerous. It can get irritated, and rarely it can grow onto the cornea, so we keep an eye on it. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Do I need an operation? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Not at all. I'd like to do a vision test with the chart now, to have a baseline."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay.",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good, your vision is excellent. I'll also take a photograph of the eye, so we can compare it in future."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Thank you. What do I do? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Wear wraparound sunglasses outdoors, keep using the drops, and avoid rubbing it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'll buy some proper sunglasses. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to see you again in six months to compare the photograph."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Six months. Thanks, doctor. ~"
  }
 ],
